UnitCLPool::GetFeeGrowthInside
├── when tickLower is gt tick upper
│   └── it reverts with TLU
├── when tick lower is lt MIN_TICK
│   └── it reverts with TLM
├── when tick upper is gt MAX_TICK
│   └── it reverts with TUM
└── when tick range is valid
    └── it returns a fee growth inside a given range
